@startuml
' Authority: Derived visual; ADR 0007 and the linked scoped contracts control.
title FGA photo-to-group add state machine

top to bottom direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state SubmissionGuard <<choice>>
state "Hard FGA no-op\nreturn stored terminal state" as HardNoOp
state "queued" as Queued
state "Check linked-user + deployment\nFlickr write gates" as ScopeGate <<choice>>
state "Scope paused\nintent state unchanged" as ScopePaused
state "attempting" as Attempting
state "Fresh getAllContexts\nmembership guard" as MembershipGuard
state "Fresh getInfo preflight\nread ispoolmoderated" as Preflight
state "Persist preflight\nand verify age" as PersistPreflight
state "Recheck gate revisions" as DispatchGate <<choice>>
state "dispatch_started\nmarker durable" as DispatchStarted
state Classify <<choice>>
state "retrying" as Retrying
state "throttled" as Throttled
state "added" as Added
state "Commit moderation result\nand permanent block" as ModerationCommit
state "moderation_submitted" as ModerationSubmitted
state "Commit uncertain result\nand permanent block" as UncertainCommit
state "delivery_uncertain" as DeliveryUncertain
state "needs_attention" as NeedsAttention
state "cancelled" as Cancelled

state "Permanent submission_blocks row\nunique Flickr photo ID + Flickr group ID\nnot an intent state" as PermanentBlock <<safety boundary>>

note right of Queued
  Active FIFO membership:
  queued, attempting, retrying, throttled.

  Terminal states leave the active FIFO atomically:
  added, moderation_submitted, delivery_uncertain,
  needs_attention, cancelled.

  The durable intent row and history remain.
end note

[*] --> SubmissionGuard : request received
SubmissionGuard --> HardNoOp : block exists
SubmissionGuard --> Queued : no block
HardNoOp --> [*]

Queued --> ScopeGate : worker holds partition lease
Retrying --> ScopeGate : retry due
Throttled --> ScopeGate : conservative probe due
ScopeGate --> Attempting : both gates enabled
ScopeGate --> ScopePaused : either gate paused\nrelease lease; no Flickr call
ScopePaused --> ScopeGate : verified administrative resume\nnormal scheduler wake-up
Queued --> Cancelled : safe cancellation before dispatch
Cancelled --> [*]

Attempting --> MembershipGuard : reserve capacity for\nmembership GET + moderation GET + possible POST
MembershipGuard --> Retrying : unavailable or incomplete\nno getInfo/POST; bounded safe-read retry
MembershipGuard --> ScopePaused : definitive account/deployment fault\npause gate; retain active head; no add
MembershipGuard --> Added : exact target group present\nterminalize from observation; no getInfo/POST
MembershipGuard --> Preflight : complete target-absent observation
Preflight --> Retrying : safe pre-dispatch failure\nno POST; persist failure count + due time
Preflight --> ScopePaused : definitive account/deployment fault\npause gate; retain active head; no POST
Preflight --> NeedsAttention : documented permanent/request-specific result\nno POST sent
Preflight --> PersistPreflight : successful response
PersistPreflight --> Preflight : observation age >= 1,000 ms\ndiscard and GET again
PersistPreflight --> DispatchGate : age < 1,000 ms
DispatchGate --> ScopePaused : gate paused or revision changed\nno marker; no POST
DispatchGate --> DispatchStarted : both revisions enabled\npersist marker
DispatchStarted --> Preflight : age now >= 1,000 ms and\nworker proves no bytes sent
DispatchStarted --> Retrying : other failure proven to occur\nbefore Flickr could receive POST
DispatchStarted --> Classify : POST sent; complete response available
DispatchStarted --> UncertainCommit : no durable zero-byte proof and\nno definitive documented durable result

Classify --> Added : Photo added (stat="ok") or\nphoto already in pool (code 3)
Classify --> Throttled : User's pool submission limit reached (code 5)\ndurably mark only this partition + next probe time
Classify --> Retrying : Service unavailable (code 105) or\ntemporary write failure (code 106)
Classify --> ModerationCommit : Photo added to pending queue (code 6) or\nalready pending (code 7)
Classify --> NeedsAttention : known permanent or account/deployment fault\ntrip applicable gate
Classify --> UncertainCommit : unknown application code\ntrip deployment gate

Added --> [*]
NeedsAttention --> [*] : no automatic retry

ModerationCommit -[dashed]-> PermanentBlock : atomically create or confirm in FGA database
ModerationCommit --> ModerationSubmitted
ModerationSubmitted --> ModerationSubmitted : later pool visibility may record\nacceptance observed; block remains
ModerationSubmitted --> [*]

UncertainCommit -[dashed]-> PermanentBlock : atomically create in FGA database
UncertainCommit --> DeliveryUncertain
DeliveryUncertain --> [*]

PermanentBlock -[dashed]-> SubmissionGuard : checked before every outbound add path

note top of SubmissionGuard
  Permanent submission block exists
  for this exact photo/group pair?
end note

note right of ScopePaused
  The durable gate is shared scope state, not an intent state.
  No timeout, process restart, or retry-now action clears it.
  Queued work retains state, due time, and FIFO order.
end note

note top of Classify
  Classify Flickr stat plus
  numeric application code.
end note

note bottom of Preflight
  This GET must be the worker attempt's immediately
  preceding Flickr API operation. Cached moderation
  metadata never satisfies the precondition.
end note

note bottom of MembershipGuard
  The complete strict membership shape must succeed.
  A cached selector or prior worker observation is not
  write authority. The observation can become stale immediately.
end note

note bottom of DispatchStarted
  The FGA group-submission worker starts POST dispatch less than 1,000 ms after
  receiving the preflight response. This bounds only
  the worker's local gap; the Flickr GET and POST are not atomic.
end note

note bottom of PermanentBlock
  Survives cancellation, reconciliation, history pruning,
  elapsed months or years, and every moderated-to-
  unmoderated-to-moderated group cycle.
  The FGA API backend and FGA LrC plug-in have no force-resubmit path.
end note

note bottom of DeliveryUncertain
  Missing, truncated, unparseable, unknown, or lost
  post-dispatch results fail closed. The FGA group-submission
  worker never retries this exact photo/group pair.
end note

@enduml
